    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure Valeria Bychkova and Robert DeVito are employees of Reck-itt Benckiser. This study was funded by Reckitt Benckiser. Dr Eugenia Radkova received funding from Reckitt Benckiser to develop the content of all study-related documents (protocol, ICF, IB, CSR). Professor Natalia Burova\u2019s organization (Federal State Establishment Clinical Diagnostic Medical Center) received funding from Reckitt Benckiser for the study. The authors report no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
